  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards People-Centred Justice &amp; Accountability Mechanisms in Burma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will strengthen outcomes from the FY25/26 Magna Carta Fund project and demonstrate a viable model for future rule-of-law support within Conflict and Governance programming. The project enables CSOs in the Spring Legal Partners network to advocate for better access to justice and legal sector reform by creating a Community of Practice, improving coordination across administrative zones, and advancing community-rooted advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
